ext":"Core Devices"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PN junction diode"},{"text":"Zener diode"},{"text":"Schottky diode"},{"text":"BJT"},{"text":"MOS capacitor"},{"text":"MOSFET"},{"text":"CMOS"},{"text":"JFET"},{"text":"Photodiodes"},{"text":"LEDs"},{"text":"Basic sensors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MOS Device Physics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accumulation"},{"text":"Depletion"},{"text":"Inversion"},{"text":"Threshold voltage"},{"text":"Body effect"},{"text":"Channel formation"},{"text":"Subthreshold operation"},{"text":"Mobility degradation"},{"text":"Short-channel effects"},{"text":"Drain-induced barrier lowering"},{"text":"Velocity saturation"},{"text":"Gate leakage"},{"text":"Junction leakage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Semiconductor Devices"},{"type":"p","text":"Introduce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinFET"},{"text":"Gate-all-around FET"},{"text":"SOI devices"},{"text":"High-k/metal-gate structures"},{"text":"Tunnel FETs"},{"text":"Nanowire FETs"},{"text":"2D-material transistors"},{"text":"Wide-bandgap devices"},{"text":"SiC MOSFETs"},{"text":"GaN HEMTs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Semiconductor Fabrication"},{"type":"p","text":"A Device Characterisation Engineer should understand how devices are manufactured because fabrication history strongly influences measured behaviour."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the semiconductor process flow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Silicon Wafer","Cleaning","Oxidation / Deposition","Photolithography","Etching","Ion Implantation / Doping","Annealing","Thin-Film Deposition","Metallization","Passivation","Wafer Testing","Device Characterisation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Important Fabrication Processes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wafer preparation"},{"text":"Thermal oxidation"},{"text":"Chemical vapor deposition"},{"text":"Physical vapor deposition"},{"text":"Atomic layer deposition"},{"text":"Photolithography"},{"text":"Electron-beam lithography concepts"},{"text":"Wet etching"},{"text":"Dry/plasma etching"},{"text":"Ion implantation"},{"text":"Diffusion"},{"text":"Annealing"},{"text":"CMP"},{"text":"Metallization"},{"text":"Passivation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cleanroom Knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cleanroom classifications"},{"text":"Contamination control"},{"text":"Wafer handling"},{"text":"ESD protection"},{"text":"Chemical safety"},{"text":"Process documentation"},{"text":"Process control"},{"text":"Yield concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Device Characterisation"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the core specialization."},{"type":"h","text":"Electrical Characterisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to measure:"},{"type":"h","text":"I-V Characteristics"},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drain current vs drain voltage"},{"text":"Gate current vs gate voltage"},{"text":"Diode forward/reverse characteristics"},{"text":"Leakage current"},{"text":"Breakdown voltage"},{"text":"On-state resistance"},{"text":"Threshold voltage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Device Under Test","Probe Station","Source Measure Unit","Apply Voltage","Measure Current","Generate I-V Curve","Extract Device Parameters","Compare With Specification / Model"]},{"type":"h","text":"C-V Characterisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Capacitance-voltage measurements are particularly important for MOS structures."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MOS capacitor"},{"text":"Accumulation"},{"text":"Depletion"},{"text":"Inversion"},{"text":"Flat-band voltage"},{"text":"Threshold voltage"},{"text":"Oxide capacitance"},{"text":"Interface traps"},{"text":"Doping concentration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["MOS Structure","Apply AC + DC Bias","Measure Capacitance","Generate C-V Curve","Extract Electrical Parameters","Compare With Device Model"]},{"type":"h","text":"Semiconductor Parameter Extraction"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to extract:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Threshold voltage"},{"text":"Subthreshold slope"},{"text":"On-current"},{"text":"Off-current"},{"text":"On/off ratio"},{"text":"Transconductance"},{"text":"Mobility"},{"text":"Contact resistance"},{"text":"Series resistance"},{"text":"Breakdown voltage"},{"text":"Leakage current"},{"text":"DIBL"},{"text":"Gate capacitance"},{"text":"Interface trap density"},{"text":"Oxide thickness"},{"text":"Sheet resistance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understanding how parameters are extracted from raw measurement data is more important than simply generating plots."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Measurement Instrumentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with semiconductor laboratory equipment."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Instruments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Source Measure Unit (SMU)"},{"text":"Semiconductor Parameter Analyzer"},{"text":"LCR meter"},{"text":"Impedance analyzer"},{"text":"Digital multimeter"},{"text":"Oscilloscope"},{"text":"Function generator"},{"text":"Pulse generator"},{"text":"Lock-in amplifier"},{"text":"Probe station"},{"text":"Temperature-controlled chuck"},{"text":"Four-point probe"},{"text":"Semiconductor curve tracer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Common measurement platforms include instruments from companies such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keysight"},{"text":"Tektronix"},{"text":"Keithley"},{"text":"Rohde & Schwarz"},{"text":"NI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The specific instrument brand is less important than understanding the measurement principle, setup, calibration and uncertainty."},{"type":"h","text":"Wafer-Level Characterisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wafer probing"},{"text":"Probe-card concepts"},{"text":"Die-level testing"},{"text":"Test structures"},{"text":"Parametric testing"},{"text":"Wafer maps"},{"text":"Process corners"},{"text":"Device-to-device variation"},{"text":"Within-wafer variation"},{"text":"Across-wafer variation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wafer","Select Test Structures","Probe Contact","Automated Measurement","Collect Device Parameters","Generate Wafer Map","Identify Spatial Variation","Analyse Process Uniformity"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Semiconductor Reliability"},{"type":"p","text":"Device characterisation increasingly overlaps with reliability engineering."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Electrical Reliability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bias temperature instability"},{"text":"Hot-carrier degradation"},{"text":"Time-dependent dielectric breakdown"},{"text":"Electromigration"},{"text":"Gate oxide breakdown"},{"text":"Stress-induced leakage"},{"text":"Contact degradation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Thermal Reliability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Self-heating"},{"text":"Thermal resistance"},{"text":"Junction temperature"},{"text":"Thermal cycling"},{"text":"Temperature-dependent leakage"},{"text":"Temperature-dependent mobility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reliability Testing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Fresh Device","Apply Electrical / Thermal Stress","Periodic Measurements","Track Parameter Degradation","Fit Reliability Model","Estimate Failure Behaviour"]},{"type":"h","text":"Device Failure Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to investigate abnormal device behaviour."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Abnormal Measurement","Verify Measurement Setup","Check Calibration","Repeat Measurement","Compare With Reference Devices","Identify Electrical Failure Signature","Correlate With Process History","Physical Failure Analysis","Root Cause","Corrective / Process Improvement Action"]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential failure mechanisms:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gate oxide defects"},{"text":"Contact failure"},{"text":"Metal migration"},{"text":"Dielectric breakdown"},{"text":"Junction leakage"},{"text":"Contamination"},{"text":"Process variation"},{"text":"Thermal damage"},{"text":"ESD damage"},{"text":"Packaging-induced failure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Physical Characterisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Electrical measurements should be complemented by physical analysis."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scanning Electron Microscopy (SEM)"},{"text":"Transmission Electron Microscopy (TEM)"},{"text":"Atomic Force Microscopy (AFM)"},{"text":"X-ray diffraction"},{"text":"X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy"},{"text":"Raman spectroscopy"},{"text":"Ellipsometry"},{"text":"Profilometry"},{"text":"Four-point probe measurements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand what each technique measures and when it should be used."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"table","header":["Technique","Typical Use"],"rows":[[{"text":"SEM"},{"text":"Surface/morphology imaging"}],[{"text":"TEM"},{"text":"Nanoscale internal structure"}],[{"text":"AFM"},{"text":"Surface topography"}],[{"text":"XRD"},{"text":"Crystal structure"}],[{"text":"XPS"},{"text":"Surface chemical composition"}],[{"text":"Raman"},{"text":"Material/strain information"}],[{"text":"Ellipsometry"},{"text":"Thin-film thickness/optical properties"}],[{"text":"Profilometer"},{"text":"Surface step/thickness"}],[{"text":"Four-point probe"},{"text":"Sheet resistance"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Optical & Material Characterisation"},{"type":"p","text":"For micro/nanoelectronics, learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Optical absorption"},{"text":"Photoluminescence"},{"text":"Raman spectroscopy"},{"text":"Refractive index"},{"text":"Thin-film properties"},{"text":"Surface roughness"},{"text":"Defect density"},{"text":"Material composition"},{"text":"Bandgap estimation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes particularly valuable for nanomaterials, 2D electronics, photonics and semiconductor R&D."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Data Analysis & Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern characterisation engineer should not depend