ctory TCAD capability."},{"text":"Understand SEM, TEM, AFM, XPS and related characterisation methods."},{"text":"Apply statistics and DOE to experimental data."},{"text":"Maintain proper laboratory and technical documentation."},{"text":"Present experimental results clearly."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio should contain measurement-oriented semiconductor projects, not only theoretical reports."},{"type":"h","text":"Project Portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"1. MOSFET I-V Characterisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Raw measurement data"},{"text":"Python analysis"},{"text":"Parameter extraction"},{"text":"Device comparison"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. MOS Capacitor C-V Characterisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"C-V curves"},{"text":"Threshold/flat-band analysis"},{"text":"Device physics interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Semiconductor Reliability Study"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stress testing"},{"text":"Degradation curves"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Lifetime modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. TCAD Device Simulation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Device structure"},{"text":"Mesh"},{"text":"Physical models"},{"text":"Simulated I-V/C-V"},{"text":"Parameter study"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Automated Characterisation Dashboard"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Measurement data ingestion"},{"text":"Automated parameter extraction"},{"text":"Wafer maps"},{"text":"Outlier detection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"6. Advanced Device Study\nChoose one:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinFET"},{"text":"GAA FET"},{"text":"SiC MOSFET"},{"text":"GaN HEMT"},{"text":"2D-material FET"},{"text":"MEMS/NEMS device"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"“A micro and nanoelectronics professional specializing in semiconductor device characterisation, combining strong device physics and semiconductor fabrication knowledge with electrical measurement, wafer-level testing, reliability analysis, Python/MATLAB-based data analysis, TCAD simulation and failure-analysis fundamentals to evaluate and improve next-generation semiconductor devices.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended progression"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. Micro & Nano Electronics → Device Characterisation Intern → Junior Device Characterisation Engineer → Device Characterisation Engineer → Senior Device/Characterisation Specialist → Principal Device Engineer → Device Technology / Characterisation Lead"}]}]}